        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Epic Linear Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This RPG boasts a vast world, offering a traditional, linear experience that allows players to fully immerse themselves in the story. Set in a single timeline, the sudden discovery of an Ancient God's Scroll forces you, the protagonist, to experience a shift in the landscape and embark on an adventure across the continent with your companions. Through your adventure, you'll gradually uncover the story of the Four Continents, the Eight Generals, and the Academy Scroll, while also experiencing the emotions and transformations of the protagonists. If you enjoy traditional, linear, turn-based RPGs, embark on this epic journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/f3a08174ae42089298b52f250c18e2d2.poster.avif?t=1765997973\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/f3a08174ae42089298b52f250c18e2d2.webm?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/f3a08174ae42089298b52f250c18e2d2.mp4?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy-to-understand Original Skill Classification</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To align with the story, skills have been redesigned to include Guigu Magic, corresponding to attack magic, support magic, and ultimate attacks. As a key feature, you'll gain access to more powerful skills as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/22e5383636439cd25802f46b1340075b.poster.avif?t=1765997973\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/22e5383636439cd25802f46b1340075b.webm?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/22e5383636439cd25802f46b1340075b.mp4?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pixel Art Reminiscent of Nostalgia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To better illustrate the geographical features of the story, I've personally created over a hundred maps over the nearly three years since I began developing the game. Each region boasts its own unique character, perfectly capturing the story. During gameplay, you'll also enjoy the visual feast of flat art, offering a traditional, authentic RPG experience without the added 3D enhancements or enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/688d2aed387314b1cd9483183d6c27e1.poster.avif?t=1765997973\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/688d2aed387314b1cd9483183d6c27e1.webm?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/688d2aed387314b1cd9483183d6c27e1.mp4?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure the game's interactions aren't limited to traditional turn-based combat, simple puzzles add a layer of fun. These puzzles aren't tedious or time-consuming; they simply add to the interactive experience. Of course, the encounters revolve around the story itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/0596be9ce7f115051e0924adf9bc24f3.poster.avif?t=1765997973\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/0596be9ce7f115051e0924adf9bc24f3.webm?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/0596be9ce7f115051e0924adf9bc24f3.mp4?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Classes and Styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features six class styles and seven weapon types. Each of the six classes has at least two advancement systems, depending on the character. Each character also equips a unique weapon type. I believe that through these settings, players will forge their own powerful style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/34f8011c6d26d97b51af0a0aa0882f2d.poster.avif?t=1765997973\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/34f8011c6d26d97b51af0a0aa0882f2d.webm?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/34f8011c6d26d97b51af0a0aa0882f2d.mp4?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rich Romance and Character Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speaking of story, it's the most crucial aspect of this game. The script, the product of over 10 years of meticulous refinement, contains countless words. During gameplay, players can choose from over 10 playable characters, each with their own unique skills and styles. While the game doesn't allow for detailed character development, the linear progression of the protagonist's story will allow you to develop a deeper understanding of some of them. If you have further character ideas, please leave a comment so I can provide more creative ideas and thoughts for future sequels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/36706cd4ed775e8c3856dafa686b4bc9.poster.avif?t=1765997973\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/36706cd4ed775e8c3856dafa686b4bc9.webm?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882300/extras/36706cd4ed775e8c3856dafa686b4bc9.mp4?t=1765997973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An independent work committed to originality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the advancement of AI technology, originality has become increasingly unpopular. But I still insist on writing my own stories. Every character, every name, every skill, even every poem, is my own creation. So players can fully enjoy the story and experience its real souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are brave, some are clever, some are silly, but all are logical. If you are lucky enough to have them as your friends, embark on this journey and become whoever you will be!</p>",
